# Reader signals — likes and views (Supabase project "sandbox-daily").
# The key is PUBLISHABLE by design: it may reach the browser without harm
# because RLS grants the anon role INSERT only, and counts are read through the
# signal_counts view. Nothing can read a raw row, so device ids never leave the
# database. Both vars are server-side (route handlers), never NEXT_PUBLIC_.
# SUPABASE_URL=https://<project-ref>.supabase.co
# SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=sb_publishable_...
